title: "NIELIT Python: language reference and capstone notebooks"
abstract: >-
  A public set of Jupyter notebooks covering the Python language and five
  complete programs: a safe expression calculator, tic-tac-toe with minimax,
  Hangman, a quiz marker, and a decimal expense ledger.
